# heavy falls: the MORE page's Heavy knob; at 100 a cluster falls about every half minute and sounds a
# low swell when it lands; at 0, none
wait 800
tap FX
tap FX
tap FX
spin K1 60
expect knob12 100
wait 50000
expect heavies >0
wait 60000
expect heavies >1
spin K1 -100
expect knob12 0
wait 200000
expect heavies <6
